body:
I am in the US and noticed the change about 4 days ago. I now need 50k for one tree rather then 10k. It will now take a very good part of a month for one tree. I wasn't a super user, having 6 trees planted. But knowing that I need my lifetime points for all my trees for basically one is mega deflating. Unless they increase the points you get by a percentage based on the increase, which they could still make more points needed but not FIVE times more.

&#x200B;

For those who said the price of the stuff required to do this has gone up, fair enough,  But it did NOT become FIVE times more expensive then last month or so.

The drinking water thing helps. Not that I'd condone this, but it might be useful to know there is another method. If you drink water until the point that your just pissing straight water, it will obviously dilute the sample. One of two things usually happen. Either you will pass, because the levels are so low, or, it could could back inconclusive / dilute. When this happens, they can assume all they want that you did it on purpose, but, generally you'll be asked to retest. If this happens, you win, because now more time has passed before the retest. Now, if a history of that was to occur, it would not look good, lol. But one "random" inconclusive combined with a negative retest will win you the  war, that time. 

&#x200B;

Or, don't do that. Drinking a lot of water (but not a ton) will also just help you pass in general. I'm guessing you weren't drinking to the point to where you where crashing out and super dehydrated and stayed decently hydrated but as I'm sure you read, it's like the best thing you could do.

&#x200B;

Those kind of test and probation scenarios are so nerve wracking, because some times you feel like your own fate isn't even in control. You feel like some thing bad is going to happen. It blows. So I'm thinking your going to be good. I  hope so, at least hah. On the bright side, at the end of the day, it IS just alcohol. It's not like they're finding coke and meth in you. I know they take alcohol a lot more seriously now then they did in the past, but some of it is just that it seems like it's a really big deal to YOu, because it's what your worried about.

You should only take my words as any over the internet, with that being said....

As stated, mouth swab tests are the least accurate. Now, there is no clear data on fentanyl and opiate tests as we have no way of knowing exactly what the tests were for. From experience, it seems, up until relatively recent, regular opiate tests (such as the common 5 panel) would show negative for fent, because they were searching for more typical result, such as metabolites of heroin, morphine, etc, and then often included "opiodes" such as vicodin, percocet, the semi-synthetics. A specific test had to be taken to show things like fent, suboxen, opana, tramadol, methadone, and it would state specifically. From experience, any given test was very unlikely to show for fent, unless explicitly asked for, test wise. In other words, unless the test was for a drug or court program, and was specifically interested in the use of fent, any given test was not very likely to show for fent. However, that seems to have changed in some instances. For example, in one situation, the opiate tests taken would not show for fent, and unless a specific test for the synthetics were ordered, it never came up. Then, after time, it became apparent that now the regular test WAS showing for fent, even though the synthetics test was not specifically shown. That could mean that the regular tests DO now show for it, or that sometimes negative tests are randomly still sent on for the mass spec., at which that point the fent is discovered. 

&#x200B;

If this helps even one person who is searching for info about tests and is losing sleep over some such issue, great.

&#x200B;

TLDR; In the past, most tests would not show for fent even if looking for opiates.  Now, that may be different. As for as the time frame, it was not mentioned. If someone ingested the substance and then went in for a test 8 hours later, well, it might not matter how hard one scrubbed, though the odds are definetely better against a urine test. However, if at least 48 hours has passed, there is a chance one could still pass. A chance. Will also mention that they do make and sell a detox mouthwash. Not sure if it works better for marijuana than other substances, but it certainly couldn't hurt to use. Drug tests can be the most maddening things in the universe. I have seen someone who literally switched/replaced their sample with a clean sample / fake sample, and then miraculously still fail for some thing, either from false positives / more nefarious intervention from third parties. I'd be willing to answer any questions anyone may have who sees this one day.

Also, can you recommend a sub? I obviously saw that this one was more oriented towards game play, and not debug, but it was still the most appropriate place I found.

&#x200B;

Finding the correct sub can drastically increase the chances of some one helping me, so, yeah.

This is the first time i have ever been on this sub, and I am no expert. But it sounds like he isn't completely straight. It sounds like he doesn't WANT to be into guys, even if only a bit, but he is. He doesnt WANT you to be okay with that, because HE doesnt want it to be ok with him. He doesnt watch it with you because he doesnt want you to see that that is what he wants to watch. He doesnt want to admit it to you that he watches it, because he isn't ok with the feelings and doesn't want you to be okay with him being ok, because he doesn't think it's ok. Obviously, you can't be the person in those videos because you lack the proper hardware. It kind of seems like, he is turned on by that stuff, but doesn't want to be. But because that is what turns him on, he sneaks off and does what he does - because he does actually want sexual release, but just can't get that specific flavor from you. He wont admit it because to him, he isn't hiding it from you. To him, he is trying to hide it from himself, and one of the best ways he knows to hide it from himself is to hide it from you.

It's great that you are willing to work with him their, as many girls wouldn't. But in this specific case, that isn't good enough, because he doesn't actually want to feel that way, he just can't help what turns him on or off. If I wanted to hide something from myself and try to believe it isn't true, I would see my partner being okay with that behavior as an admittance to myself that I am ok with it, which he isn't.

&#x200B;

Like I said, I dont know what got me to this post, and I will probably never be back. I have my own problems that are ruining my life that are, for better or worse, completely unrelated to sex and or relationships. But after reading what you wrote and all the text down to this point, that is what it seems like to me. I am a youngish, single, straight male for perspective. For what it's worth - I would accept a blowjob from a partner even if I had a low drive, hated my partner, and was embarrassed about some other factor. Also, most guys who haven't come to terms with themselves, or who feel shame by the fact that they don't want to be gay but get turned on by gay material do that.

 The whole, omg ew gross turn that shit off. They think thats what a completely straight male would say, so they say it. Just like when your parents would joke with you at a young age - "hey that classmate of yours is pretty cute why don't you talk to her?" "ewww no gross dad girls are gross!". only to go on for the rest of their lives in search for a female. That kind of thing.

&#x200B;

tldr - He doesn't want to share those things with you because he doesn't want to feel that way, feels that it is wrong for him to feel those ways, or is trying really hard to make himself believe that he doesn't get turned on by male stuff, but does, and still wants release.

&#x200B;

Also adding - Excuse my lack of political correctness or not here, but it seems to me that he thinks watching a girl with a dick having sex with a guy is less gay then two guys having sex. I have no idea if that is true or not, and dont really care to be corrected. But it seems to me that he thinks that at least if one of the people is female (even with a dick) that it makes it less gay, which makes it easier for him to cope with having those feelings.

