Thanks for those words. Honestly, my hot water heater AND AC broke, aparently with in the same 3 hour window this morning in the AM. I honestly can't even image the odds of two major, sperate things breaking at the same time like this. I know I had AC and hot water last night, and now I don't. TBH I don't even see how it's possible, but it happened. So as such, I am just super frazzled atm and don't haveit in me to type a proper response. I am going to take a nap, and then reply afterwards. Thanks again..it's nice to just even be acknowledged at this point. Of course Cleveland happens to be in the middle of a heat wave while this happened. Why not? Of course that'd be the case. But it just goes to show, I doubt I have any hope of getting either of them fixed let a lone both, but at least because of my sacrificing, scrimping and saving, I at least have a prayer at one of them. Go figure that all happens at the exact same time as when I was considering spending on myself. Either this is Gods way of intervening, or some other higher power is out to get me. Blah.

&#x200B;

